    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available Immediately** **Flexible Lease Term** **Furnished/Unfurnished** Sherry FitzGerald Lettings are delighted to present Dún Mhuire, a ten-bedroom, ten-bathroom home extending to 1,269sqm. With panoramic vistas of Killiney Hill Park, Dún Mhuire is ideally positioned beside Killiney dart station. The house is accessible to the M50 and all transport links.\r\n\r\nAccommodation in brief, large entrance hall leading into three big receptions, upstairs there are ten bedrooms all ensuite. Each bedroom has built in wardrobe space. In the basement there is a large kitchen to include, gas cooker, large fridge freezer, dishwasher and a separate utility room off the hall with washer/dryer. The house has ample storage throughout. Secure driveway parking for a large number of cars. Viewing is highly recommended of this unique property. **Professionally managed by Sherry FitzGerald Lettings**"
      },
      {
